{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planet Gemini</strong> is a factory building and tower defense game. On two planets that crash-landed during a dimension trip, survive against incoming enemies and research on a portal to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Planets</strong>:\u00a0Teleporting two planets that have different resources and building a base to defense enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-Op</strong>:\u00a0It's not easy to manage two planets on your own. Play with your friends and challenge harder difficulties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Factory Automation</strong>:\u00a0Gather resources and research technology to build more efficient automation facilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tower Defense</strong>:\u00a0Build a defense line with the resources that you produced and complete the portal study successfully</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3183170?t=1757763478","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3183170?t=1757763478","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183170/dd5d8a01b83e4bfd178d7692601d4cabcbea53fe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757763478","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3183170/dd5d8a01b83e4bfd178d7692601d4cabcbea53fe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757763478","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Planet Gemini</strong> is a factory building and tower defense game. On two planets that crash-landed during a dimension trip, survive against incoming e